        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Add a new element",
            "id": 89146,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per aggiungere un nuovo valore a un insieme come <code>answers</code>, scrivi <code>add()</code>, inserendo il nuovo valore, come <code>\"maybe\"</code>, tra le parentesi.</p><p>Nota che gli elementi nei set non sono ordinati. Pertanto, non possiamo essere certi dell'ordine in cui gli elementi appariranno quando verranno stampati.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"answers = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;no&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"answers.add(\" /><text value=\"&quot;maybe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(answers)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"44\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{'no', 'maybe', 'yes'}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>answers</code>, seguito da <code>.add</code> e infine <code>(\"maybe\")</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per aggiungere un nuovo valore a un insieme come <code>answers</code>, scrivi <code>add()</code>, inserendo il nuovo valore, come <code>\"maybe\"</code>, tra le parentesi.</p><p>Nota che gli elementi nei set non sono ordinati. Pertanto, non possiamo essere certi dell'ordine in cui gli elementi appariranno quando verranno stampati.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"answers = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;no&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"answers.add(\" /><text value=\"&quot;maybe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(answers)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".remove\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".append\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>answers</code>, seguito da <code>.add</code> e infine <code>(\"maybe\")</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "No duplicates",
            "id": 89309,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Poiché i set escludono i valori duplicati, non succede nulla quando usi <code>add()</code> con un valore già esistente come <code>\"yes\"</code>.</p><p>Ancora una volta, l'ordine degli elementi in un insieme potrebbe cambiare.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"answers = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;no&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"answers.add(\" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(answers)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"41\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{'yes', 'no'}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>\"yes\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Add a new element",
            "id": 89392,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale istruzione usiamo per aggiungere un nuovo valore a un set?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">L'istruzione <code>add()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">L'istruzione <code>+</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">L'istruzione <code>add()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>L'istruzione <code>add()</code> aggiunge un nuovo valore a un set.</p><p>Quale riga aggiunge <code>\"green\"</code> a <code>colors</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>colors.add(\"green\")</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>colors + \"green\"</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>colors.append(\"green\")</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>colors.add(\"green\")</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: No duplicates",
            "id": 89393,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cosa succede quando usiamo <code>add()</code> per aggiungere un valore che il set contiene già?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Il valore non verrà aggiunto, perché non sono consentiti duplicati</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Il set conterrà due valori uguali</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Il valore non verrà aggiunto, perché non sono consentiti duplicati.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando <code>add()</code> riceve un valore già presente nel set, non lo aggiunge perché i duplicati non sono consentiti.</p><p>Se <code>colors = {\"red\", \"blue\"}</code>, cosa rimane dopo <code>colors.add(\"red\")</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Gli stessi due valori univoci</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Due copie di <code>\"red\"</code> e una di <code>\"blue\"</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Un set vuoto, perché il duplicato lo svuota</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gli stessi due valori univoci.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Add a new element",
            "id": 89394,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi una nuova email alla mailing list degli iscritti usando <code>add()</code> e il valore <code>\"luke@mail.com\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"subscribers = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;jess@mail.com&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;meg@mail.com&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"subscribers.add(\" /><text value=\"&quot;luke@mail.com&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(subscribers)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"81\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{'meg@mail.com', 'luke@mail.com', 'jess@mail.com'}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>subscribers</code>, seguito da <code>.add</code> e poi <code>(</code>, <code>\"luke@mail.com\"</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi una nuova email alla mailing list degli iscritti usando <code>add()</code> e il valore <code>\"luke@mail.com\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"subscribers = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;jess@mail.com&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;meg@mail.com&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"subscribers.add(\" /><text value=\"&quot;luke@mail.com&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(subscribers)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".append\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".remove\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>subscribers</code>, seguito da <code>.add</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>\"luke@mail.com\"</code> e infine <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: No duplicates",
            "id": 89395,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi un valore all'insieme <code>wishlist</code>, in modo che l'insieme rimanga invariato.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"wishlist = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;earpods&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;notebook&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;handgloves&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"wishlist.add(\" /><text value=\"&quot;notebook&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;watch&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>\"notebook\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi un valore al set <code>wishlist</code> in modo che la sua dimensione rimanga <code>3</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"wishlist\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text value=\"&quot;earpods&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;notebook&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;handgloves&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"wishlist\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"add\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;notebook&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;watch&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;charger&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>\"notebook\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 9966,
        "title": "Insiemi avanzati",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lists and indices",
            "id": 89310,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sappiamo che possiamo accedere agli elementi delle liste come <code>user_answers</code> e aggiornarli tramite il loro indice, come qui con <code>0</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"user_answers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;no&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(user_answers[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"])\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"user_answers[1]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"yes\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>user_answers[0]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Le liste come <code>user_answers</code> sono ordinate, quindi possiamo leggere un elemento tramite il suo indice. Stampa l'elemento uguale a <code>no</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"user_answers\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"[\" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;no&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"user_answers\" /><text value=\"[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"user_answers[0]\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"user_answers[1]\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"user_answers[3]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"no\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>user_answers[2]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "No indices",
            "id": 89311,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A differenza delle liste, gli insiemi come <code>answer_options</code> non sono ordinati, il che significa che gli elementi degli insiemi non hanno indici.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"user_answers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;no&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(user_answers[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"answer_options = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;no&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option startIndex=\"84\" endIndex=\"97\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>answer_options</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>{\"yes\", \"no\"}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A differenza delle liste, gli insiemi come <code>answer_options</code> non sono ordinati, il che significa che gli elementi degli insiemi non hanno indici.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"user_answers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;no&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(user_answers[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"answer_options = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;no&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option startIndex=\"84\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[&quot;yes&quot;, &quot;no&quot;]\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(&quot;yes&quot;, &quot;no&quot;)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>answer_options</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>{\"yes\", \"no\"}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "in keyword",
            "id": 89312,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Poiché gli insiemi non hanno indici, possiamo solo verificare se un insieme contiene un elemento come <code>\"no\"</code> con la parola chiave <code>in</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"answer_options = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;no&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;no&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" answer_options)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"44\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>in</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "For loop",
            "id": 89313,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo anche usare un ciclo for per iterare sugli elementi di un set e accedervi uno alla volta, come qui con la variabile <code>answer</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"answer_options = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;no&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" answer \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" answer_options:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Option: \" /><text value=\"{answer}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"86\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Option: no\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Option: yes\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>answer</code>, seguito da <code>answer</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un ciclo <code>for</code> accede agli elementi del set uno alla volta. Usa <code>answer</code> come variabile del ciclo e mostra <code>Option:</code> prima di ogni valore.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"answer_options = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;yes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;no&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" answer \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" answer_options:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Option: \" /><text value=\"{answer}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"while\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"answer_options\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>for</code>, seguito da <code>answer</code> e infine <code>answer</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: No indices",
            "id": 89397,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa significa che gli insiemi non sono ordinati?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Non hanno indici, quindi non possiamo accedere agli elementi né aggiornarli in base al loro indice</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Tutti gli elementi hanno lo stesso indice</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Non hanno indici, quindi non possiamo accedere agli elementi né aggiornarli in base al loro indice.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>I set non sono ordinati e non hanno indici, quindi non possiamo accedere agli elementi o aggiornarli tramite indice.</p><p>Quale operazione dovresti evitare per un set chiamato <code>colors</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>colors[0]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>for color in colors:</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>colors.add(\"green\")</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>colors[0]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: in keyword",
            "id": 89398,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come possiamo verificare se un set contiene un elemento?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Utilizzo della parola chiave <code>in</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Accedendovi tramite il suo indice</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Utilizzo della parola chiave <code>in</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usiamo la parola chiave <code>in</code> per verificare se un set contiene un elemento.</p><p>Quale espressione verifica se <code>colors</code> contiene <code>\"red\"</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"red\" in colors</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>colors[0] == \"red\"</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>colors.count(\"red\")</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>\"red\" in colors</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: For loop",
            "id": 89399,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come possiamo accedere agli elementi di un set dato che i set non hanno indici?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Usando un ciclo for per accedere agli elementi uno alla volta</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Non possiamo accedere affatto agli elementi di un set</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Usando un ciclo for per accedere agli elementi uno alla volta.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usiamo un ciclo <code>for</code> per accedere agli elementi di un set uno alla volta, perché i set non hanno indici.</p><p>Quale riga visita ogni elemento di <code>colors</code>, memorizzandolo in <code>color</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>for color in colors:</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>for color in colors[0]:</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>while color in colors:</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>for color in colors:</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
